From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 23:43:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 29/31] function runner: stop after a complete shadow identity
 match

Stop bounded inserted-document identity search once one mapping explains the write set, returned result, and read dependencies together. Enumerating equivalent remaining mappings cannot change the semantic verdict and could turn an otherwise equivalent mutation into an unresolved comparison after the search bound.
---
 crates/function_runner/src/query_shadow.rs | 207 ++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 142 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)

